@format 1
@id edit.change-skip
@title Change edit skip state
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Enable or disable Skip for the active Edit source, synchronize the processing list, and request plan persistence.
@section I. UI
@tabs Edit
@flow TB
@related edit.save-plan, edit.change-crop, edit.change-tone

@alias inspector = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PInspector
@alias processing = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PProcessing
@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PEditTab

[input] Skip state changes <input>
- Publish the Skip Apply control change @ inspector.PSkipBodyBuild(...)
> update

[update] Synchronize edit state <process>
- Update the visible No Processing state @ processing.PProcessingSkipSet(...)
- Receive the Skip event and request an active-source plan save @ tab.PEditSkipHandle(...)
> persist

[persist] Continue to plan persistence <output>
> map:edit.save-plan
